  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RSW_DragonsnakeAlbino</defName>
    <label>albino dragonsnake</label>
    <description>A rare pale dragonsnake: a gigantic limbless serpent, bone-white from its long skull-like head to the end of its glossy ringed coils. It has no visible eyes, hunts by feel and heat under murky swamp water, and strikes with a mouth full of long needle fangs that drip a venom strong enough to drop an armoured hunter. The Hutts of Nal Hutta are said to keep one in a pit under their throne room. Its eggs hatch ordinary dragonsnakes: the pale strain does not breed true.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>2.8</MoveSpeed>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-10</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>80</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <MarketValue>3500</MarketValue>
